<title>USA: DeForest ASD, Wis., won by Robert Baird.</title>
<headline>DeForest ASD, Wis., won by Robert Baird.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert Baird said it won $5.800 million of DeForest ASD, Wis., general obligation school building bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.362 percent.</p>
</text>
